& [P6SurfaceSupportAndRequirementDeltaLedger] is the support and requirement delta ledger for P6 surface implementation activation
  + [support_delta] is P6 surface implementation has accepted pure surface projection envelope, nonpromotion, surface matrix, and inbound action classifier helpers
  + [support_delta] is P6 surface implementation has accepted generated projection path policy and in-memory fixture runner
  + [support_delta] is P6 surface implementation has accepted tests and generated projection nonpromotion/no-live-effect proof
  + [support_delta] is P6 surface dependency, adapter, transport, UI, Langflow, dispatch, operations, and live-control work remains deferred
  + [requirement_delta] is downstream P7 and P9 readiness may consume P6 surface implementation only as bounded projection and proof evidence
  + [requirement_delta] is downstream work must not treat P6 surface evidence as dependency, adapter, dispatch, operations-control, or live-control authority
  + [requirement_delta] is future multi-user and multi-agent collaboration surfaces require separate source-preserved adapter and dispatch authority paths

  ! [P6SurfaceImplementationProofPackAccepted] is accepted
    @ [support] [P6SurfaceAcceptedArtifactHashLedger]
    @ [support] [P6SurfaceValidationCommandLedger]
    @ [support] [P6SurfaceNoAuthorityLeakLedger]
    @ [support] [P6SurfaceSupportAndRequirementDeltaLedger]
